WEBVTT

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.860
Another one of the same.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:27.140
Here alone? What do you say,
want to come with me after this?

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:33.450
Thank you.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.050
That was cold!

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.310
You didn't have to ignore me.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.490
Don't involve yourself with me.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.830
See? I told you.

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:58.810
I've had enough!

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:01.390
I clean and clean, but you
just make it total chaos again!

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:03.490
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:06.680
I'm telling you to clean up after
yourself when you're done eating!

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:09.680
Okay, sure. Check in again tomorrow.

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:10.680
Tomorrow?

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:14.890
Yep. Tomorrow, they'll
mysteriously be cleaned up.

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:15.630
Huh?

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.710
That's because I clean them up!

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.240
That's another way of putting it.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:23.610
Sheesh!

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.600
--Hurry up and clean, already!
--Ow.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.470
Okay, fine!

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:32.780
Jeez... This is one of those "Your parents
must be really something" situations.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.630
I don't...

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.310
I don't have any parents.

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:46.330
No, that's not what I meant by that...

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:47.750
Hey, you... Ow!

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.220
Hey... No, wait!

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:52.950
Dante, you jerk! Well, forget you!

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:58.690
Hey, is Pat...

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:03.600
Made her mad again, huh?

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:04.330
Shut up.

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:08.710
What do you want? If you're going to
clean up for me, you're very welcome.

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:11.660
You want someone to do that, hire a maid.

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:14.230
You can use the pay from this job.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:28.650
I'd like you to hold on to this for a while.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:32.990
Isn't this a job for the coin
lockers at the train station, Morrison?

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:34.840
Come on, don't be so hasty.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:38.720
See, this is a historic
heirloom that's been passed down

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.540
in Miss Nina's family for generations.

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:44.390
This pendant is priceless.

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:49.720
She says that she inherited it when her old
man died, but that in the ten years since then,

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:53.710
those who want it are out for her
blood whenever they smell a chance.

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:57.740
Ten years... Why do you suddenly want
to give it to someone after that long?

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:02.310
Well, the attacks weren't
so frequent up until now,

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:06.430
but lately she's targeted all the time,
and she's frequently been in danger.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:09.510
So, it's time for you to step in.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:13.640
Would you take this on for me?

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:16.240
I don't want to hear any
stupid answers, partner.

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:19.600
Sure, all right. I was at loose ends anyway.

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:21.660
I'll take on the job for you.

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:34.480
That jerk Dante.

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:37.240
He just has no delicacy!

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:39.260
Jeez, he doesn't have any parents either...

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:00.720
Hi, Dante!

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:02.680
Oh, you're alone today?

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:04.390
I'm always alone, you know that.

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:07.880
Now, now, girls that age
get hurt real easily.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:11.260
Hurry up and apologize to
Shortie, and make friends again.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.310
Heh, it's none of your business.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.880
You hurry up and bring me the usual.

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:17.220
Okay!

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:18.950
Sheesh...

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:28.970
Dante, you jerk!

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.640
Why the long face?

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:38.560
If you've got the time to sit here grumbling
into your sundae dish, go do some work.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:41.470
You still haven't paid back
all you owe me, you know.

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:42.940
I'm doing work now.

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:45.390
What's this?

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:46.410
A pendant.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:51.260
I can see that! I'm asking you,
what's with this pendant?

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.760
I'm its bodyguard...

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:55.780
No, necklace-guard, I guess.

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:58.760
That wasn't funny.

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:00.570
Thanks for waiting!

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:12.500
Mom...

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.730
Huh, can it really be that valua...

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:19.560
What's with you?

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:25.100
This one thing I can't let you
turn into payment on the debt.

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:28.780
As if I'd take it! It's not yours.

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:29.490
--Got it!
--Hey!

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:33.960
Even I'm not that evil, you know.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:46.900
Well, work hard and pay me back soon.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:08.140
This just isn't right.

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:11.900
It's too late to say that.
You've already handed it over to him.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:14.390
We just have to watch over
him and see what happens.

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:19.020
I did what you told me because
you said he could handle it, but...

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:22.380
I didn't want to let you
face any more danger.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:25.960
And it's true that he's a man we can trust.

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:33.760
If I just carry that pendant, I have
the power to defeat lower-level ones.

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:35.760
I know that.

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:38.930
But there's no guarantee that
your attackers will always be small fry.

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:39.750
True, but...

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.400
It looks like it's begun.

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:50.590
Who the hell are you?

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:56.200
Where did the woman go?

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:00.260
Do you have the magic stone now?

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.830
By "magic stone," do you mean this?

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:25.060
Wait! What are you even going
to do if you go out there now?

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.170
Please, let me go.

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:28.440
Nina!

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:53.050
If I just get that magic stone,
I'll have the power of my master.

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:57.390
I don't know what you're talking about,

00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:59.770
but anyway, it's time to go to sleep now.

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:02.690
Bye.

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:20.870
Man, I thought I'd be able to
have a little more fun there.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:25.380
My, my. If you came to cheer me on, too bad.

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:26.880
Things just ended.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.640
Pretty wicked, aren't you?

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:35.100
After all, you kept quiet about the fact
that the ones after the necklace were devils.

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.530
You defeated the devil?

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.850
This type of thing is my specialty, you see.

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:41.840
So, who's that?

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.850
An old friend.

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:45.140
I'm Simon.

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:48.110
Simon's the one who told me about you.

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:51.470
He told me there was an odd-jobs
man who would even protect

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:52.820
a demon-summoning pendant.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.660
But please give it back.

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:59.630
I just can't let strangers be
put in danger because of me!

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:03.530
Then will you give me my pay
for the work I've done up 'til now?

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:05.140
Yes, I'll pay you tomorrow.

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:07.200
Then tomorrow is when I'll return this, too.

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:11.940
All right. I'll come to your office tomorrow.

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:14.310
Wait, Mom!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:15.950
Mom!

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:17.010
Patty?

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:19.940
Mom. Mo...

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:22.940
Mom!

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:25.330
Mom...

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:27.590
Come on, I'll drive you home.

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:30.080
Come to the office tomorrow
like you always do.

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:35.290
That woman you think is your mother
is supposed to show up with my pay.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:41.810
I know she's my mother!

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:56.660
So you think you can take
care of me any time, eh?

00:11:57.200 --> 00:12:01.460
Your conceit will be the death of you, Dante.

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:34.150
Come on, Patty, cheer up already and clean...

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:37.140
Whatever, never mind.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:44.640
Man, she's really late, isn't she?

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:48.310
She'd better really be trustworthy, Morrison.

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:49.760
What are you saying?

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:53.720
You trusted her enough to
tell her to bring your pay here.

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:55.570
That's not what I mean.

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:58.870
You're wondering whether
she might be a demon herself?

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:05.580
Sure, she didn't tell me the crew out
for her necklace were demons either,

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:08.680
but she herself seemed
like a normal human to me.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:12.760
And she's renting a hotel room here
in the human world, all normal-like.

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:13.890
What hotel?

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.210
The Grandia Hotel, if memory serves.

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:20.240
Sheesh...

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:23.260
Please, don't make this place
any more of a mess than it is.

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:26.040
You're not one to talk, Dante!

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:28.320
Hey!

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:34.060
What's with Patty?
I thought she wanted to see Nina.

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:38.270
Beats me. She probably remembered
some TV show she wanted to watch.

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:40.650
She's a hopeless brat.

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:45.220
Phone, Dante.

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:48.210
Jeez, what a pain.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:52.820
Devil May Cry.

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:54.380
Oh, it's you?

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:58.070
What? Are you sure about that?

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:04.510
Of course. I came all the way out
to the public library to confirm it.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.680
If you need them, I'll collect
the references for you, too.

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:09.400
Yeah, good idea. Thanks, I'm counting on you.

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.410
Was that Nina?

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:14.710
Nope. More than about Nina,
it was about this necklace's...

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:18.180
Hey, Morrison, what did
you do with the pendant?

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:19.250
Huh?!

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:23.750
Mom...

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:30.700
Patty...

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.810
Simon! Come in.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:40.540
Thanks.

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:44.800
Perfect timing. I have a favor to ask of you.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:45.520
A favor?

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:48.140
I'd like you to go to that
odd-job man's place now

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:51.470
and get back the pendant
in exchange for this pay.

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.640
You can just go yourself.

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:55.290
I don't want to go.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:59.390
Because that "Patty" girl
might be there, perhaps?

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:03.930
I can't be with her. You should know that.

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:06.380
Yes... Yes, you're right.

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:08.720
Oh, did you do something to your hand?

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.310
Nothing really, I just spilled
some coffee this morning.

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:15.610
But I thought you couldn't stand coffee...

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:20.150
Oh, was that right?

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:24.040
You...

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:38.090
That's strange. I can't
imagine the book is that popular.

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:47.430
My, this is a surprise. Do devils study too?

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:52.120
Unlike Dante, I have an
avid thirst for knowledge.

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:55.150
--By the way, that book...
--Huh?

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.630
What the heck is the deal?

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:03.160
Never mind, just drive faster.

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:03.840
You got it.

00:16:14.430 --> 00:16:16.160
Are you awake?

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:21.640
Who are you?

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.680
--A good question.
--What do you want?

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:28.640
What do I want? You should
know that better than anyone else.

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:31.710
But it only means anything to demons...

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:33.930
Are you a demon?

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:38.140
But if you are,
the pendant should react to you...

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:41.970
True, that stone reacts
to the powers of demons.

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:48.220
But when the demon's power is just too
weak, it doesn't have much of an effect.

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:50.770
My powers are extremely weak.

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:53.240
I'm a demon with no power.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:57.810
As you can see, to take human form,

00:16:57.810 --> 00:17:01.090
I have to actually wear human skin!

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:03.980
Then, Simon is...

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:07.610
Sorry, but I threw away the insides.

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:13.610
That's how it is, Nina Lowell.

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:19.920
Now if I get the final part, your necklace,

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:23.510
I'll have everything I need.

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:36.410
About the guest that's reserved the suite...

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:43.220
Hey!

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:50.390
I'm telling you, we can't give out
information about guests. It's the policy of--

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:56.070
Would you rather break hotel policy,
or have a big hole open up in your face?

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:03.560
Now, I guess it's about
time to go pick them up.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:04.600
Pick them up?

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:08.010
Don't play dumb with me. I know.

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:12.010
That necklace, and your daughter...

00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:16.720
I need both together, or I can't
complete the ceremony, right?

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:19.560
Please, just leave Patty out of this.

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:23.580
"Leave her out of this," huh?

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.480
Yeah, you would want that.

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:31.150
After all, that's why you had to
part ways with your own daughter.

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:33.680
Patty!

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:37.610
You really are my mother?

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:39.090
Patty, run away!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.780
You really are my mother, aren't you.

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:45.030
Patty, never mind, just run!

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:49.750
This is a happy surprise.

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:55.550
I never imagined you'd bring
that to me of your own free will.

00:18:55.550 --> 00:18:59.730
I guess that means luck
has finally turned my way.

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:05.380
All right, take the necklace and
go stand in front of that altar.

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:07.890
Patty, you mustn't listen to what this man...

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:09.290
Mom!

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.060
You keep your mouth shut!

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:14.280
Now, hurry up. Otherwise...

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.810
No, Pat--

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:22.340
Get a move on!

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:33.680
Yes, there is fine.

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:38.910
Now all you have to do is place that
necklace on the center of the altar.

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:42.650
Hurry!

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:46.010
Hurry!

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:55.520
Patty, stop!

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:59.090
Okay, is this what you wanted?

00:19:59.730 --> 00:20:01.790
Will you let Mom go, then?

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:04.360
Sure, that's fine. Here!

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:05.230
Mom!

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:20.840
It's here! It's here!

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:27.220
Now I can become a king of the demon world
that surpasses even the four great devils!

00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:31.840
Mom! Mom...

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:32.770
What have...

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:34.970
What have we done?

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:36.210
Mom?

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:39.580
Dante!

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:42.420
Ack! What the heck is going on?!

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:45.140
Morrison, take these two
and get away from the hotel.

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:45.990
H-Hey!

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:54.130
While you're at it, I suggest chasing
everyone else out of the hotel, too!

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:56.010
As if I can get that many out at once!

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:57.910
Dante!

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:04.130
--What's this?
--What happened?

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:10.760
Whatever, just evacuate everyone, fast!

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:13.720
I can't very well just...

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:15.110
Get your ass in gear!

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:29.740
You can come here,
but you're too late to do anything.

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:35.670
Unfortunately for you,
I've gotten hold of Abigail's legacy.

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:39.150
You're always scurrying around
behind the scenes pulling cheap tricks...

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:42.630
I've gotten really sick of seeing your face.

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:45.120
How about we say our goodbyes?

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:53.380
What, did you think I'd beg
for my life or something?

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:58.730
Fool. I'm different than I was before.

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:00.940
I'll show you.

00:22:02.180 --> 00:22:03.450
Everyone hurry!

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:10.960
I'll show you the power of Abigail,
who once rivaled the demon king!

00:22:29.560 --> 00:22:31.480
What the heck?

00:22:32.760 --> 00:22:33.780
It's over.

00:22:34.470 --> 00:22:36.890
The world is ending.

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:47.160
Don't you go dying, Dante.

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:07.010
Everything with a beginning also has an end.

00:24:07.550 --> 00:24:09.230
That's the rule.

00:24:09.860 --> 00:24:15.180
It may be sad, but looking all gloomy
just because it's the end isn't my thing.

00:24:15.870 --> 00:24:19.820
Since it's the end, all the more
reason to paint the town red instead.

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:24.540
If you do that, you can keep
smiling no matter how things pan out.